    "title": "Oil Prices Lower Alongside Possibility of US-Iran Truce - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Subscribe ,\n1 days ago Oil prices fell about 1% on Friday as markets weighed the possibility of a truce between the US and Iran against concerns that increasing attacks against Saudi Arabia by Houthi fighters could disrupt supply from the Middle Eastern producer. Brent futures were down $1.14, or 1.1%, at $105.46 a barrel... Read full article",
